       "html": "Hona hemen testuliburu on batean irakurri dugun problema: «An athlete carrying a horizontal 20-ft-long pole runs at a speed <math display=\"inline\"><mi>v</mi></math> such that <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>/</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> Atletaren markoan, zeinean gela bakarrik baitago. 5 ft long, how this is possible. [Hint: no effect travels faster than light.] Show that the minimum Gelaren luzera trikimailu honen errendimendua da <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>/</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math> ft. Draw a space-time diagrama atletaren gainerako markoan gertatzen ari dena adierazteko.Click <br> Enuntziatua iluna bada ere, badirudi esan nahi dena hauxe dela: pertika osoa gelaren barruan lehenengoz"
